      "code": "",
      "note": "strncpy returns char * (the destination pointer pwd), but its return value is implicitly converted to size_t and assigned to len. This overwrites the caller-supplied buffer length with a stack address, corrupting len from its actual value (28) to a huge number (~0x7fff...).",
      "kind": "root_cause_function"
    },
